status` to invoices with default `open`.\n- Preserve historical invoice `created_at`.\n- Preserve orphan payments by moving them to `payment_orphans` before enforcing referential safety.\n- Enforce future `payments.invoice_id` references to valid invoices.\n- The migration must run inside an explicit transaction.\n- The migration must be idempotent: running it a second time must not duplicate or corrupt data.\n- Rollback must execute after the migration and restore the old table shape: `invoices(id, customer_id, total_cents, created_at)` and `payments(id, invoice_id, amount_cents, created_at)`.\n\nConstraints:\n- Do not modify `schema.sql` or `migration_policy.md`.\n- Do not delete orphan payment `p4`; preserve it in `payment_orphans`.\n- Do not disable foreign keys without restoring them.\n- Do not hard-code a solution that only works by deleting existing rows.\n- Do not use external services or non-SQLite features.\n"}],"attribution":"user","timestamp":1788159234665},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b2402d027fd5293016a952505fe7c87d2afde2dffa9557b74\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"94b191d0-65e3-48e9-a72b-249536dee2a9\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"94b191d0-65e3-48e9-a72b-249536dee2a9\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_NG4ZUEsbZGC5oeFjJujrMEz9|fc_0b2402d027fd5293016a952506d1fc87d298a5c540f03b3994","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Track migration package repair","op":"init","list":[{"phase":"Assess","items":["Read policy schema and existing migration files"]},{"phase":"Implement","items":["Repair migration and add operational SQL scripts","Write preflight and migration reports"]},{"phase":"Verify","items":["Execute migration postcheck and rollback scenarios"]}],"task":null,"phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Track migration package repair"}]